  "title": "browser-manuscript",
  "body": "<h1>The notebook</h1><p>The notebook was <span data-comment-id=\"ee1a4fcc-a91b-4be9-8063-116e211e4496\" data-comment-author=\"You\" data-comment-color=\"var(--color-writer-note)\" class=\"twyne-comment-mark\" style=\"background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-writer-note) 18%, transparent); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-writer-note); cursor: text;\">small enough to carry in a coat pocket.</span> By November, its corners had softened and the cover had begun to remember the shape of a hand.</p><p>Most pages held ordinary things: the name of a book, a sentence overheard on the train, the hours of a shop she kept arriving at after it had closed.</p><h2>A note for the next draft</h2><p>Keep the opening concrete. <span data-comment-id=\"a2e634dd-4ca5-4963-b145-e787ab4bab0c\" data-comment-author=\"You\" data-comment-color=\"var(--color-writer-note)\" class=\"twyne-comment-mark\" style=\"background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-writer-note) 18%, transparent); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-writer-note); cursor: text;\">Let the change in the room carry the ending.</span></p>",
